      "name": "well-records",
      "notes": "This dataset provides information submitted by well contractors as prescribed\r\nby Regulation 903, and is stored in the Water Well Information System (WWIS).\r\nSpatial information for all of the well records reported in Ontario are also\r\nprovided.\r\n\r\n[Well record map](https://www.ontario.ca/page/map-well-records) \r\n\r\n  *[WWIS]: Water Well Information System\r\n\r\nThis data is related to: \r\n\r\n* [Well records](https://www.ontario.ca/page/well-records) \r\n* [Map: Well records](https://www.ontario.ca/environment-and-energy/map-well-records) \r\n* [Topic: Drinking water](https://www.ontario.ca/page/drinking-water) \r\n* Law: [Reg. 903: Wells](https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/900903) \r\n\r\nRelated data:\r\n\r\n* [Petroleum wells](https://www.ontario.ca/data/petroleum-wells) \r\n\r\n",
      "notes_translated": {
        "en": "This dataset provides information submitted by well contractors as prescribed\r\nby Regulation 903, and is stored in the Water Well Information System (WWIS).\r\nSpatial information for all of the well records reported in Ontario are also\r\nprovided.\r\n\r\n[Well record map](https://www.ontario.ca/page/map-well-records) \r\n\r\n  *[WWIS]: Water Well Information System\r\n\r\nThis data is related to: \r\n\r\n* [Well records](https://www.ontario.ca/page/well-records) \r\n* [Map: Well records](https://www.ontario.ca/environment-and-energy/map-well-records) \r\n* [Topic: Drinking water](https://www.ontario.ca/page/drinking-water) \r\n* Law: [Reg. 903: Wells](https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/900903) \r\n\r\nRelated data:\r\n\r\n* [Petroleum wells](https://www.ontario.ca/data/petroleum-wells) \r\n\r\n",
        "fr": "Cet ensemble de donnees sur les registres de puits fournit des renseignements\r\nqui ont ete soumis par les entrepreneurs de puits comme l'exige le Reglement\r\n903, et est conserve dans le Systeme d'information sur les puits d'eau (SIPE).\r\nDes donnees spatiales relatives a tous les registres de puits soumis en\r\nOntario sont egalement fournies.\r\n\r\n[Carte des registres de puits](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/page/registre-de-puits)\r\n\r\n  *[SIPE]: Syst\u00e8me d\u2019information sur les puits d\u2019eau\r\n\r\nCes donn\u00e9es sont li\u00e9es \u00e0 :\r\n\r\n* [Registres de puits](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/page/registres-de-puits) \r\n* [Carte : Registre de puits](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/environnement-et-energie/registre-de-puits)\r\n* [Sujet : Eau potable](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/recherche/resultats-de-recherche?balise=Eau%20potable) \r\n* Loi : [R\u00e8gl. 903 : Puits](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/lois/reglement/900903) \r\n\r\nDonn\u00e9es connexes :\r\n\r\n* [Puits de p\u00e9trole](https://www.ontario.ca/fr/donnees/puits-de-petrole) \r\n\r\n"
      },
